WEBVTT

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.820
Episode 16

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:48.190
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:58.290
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.960
You should leave quickly

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.200
Shut up

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.720
I will protect you

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:08.390
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.150
Brother! Let us go!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.200
Please!

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.990
If you let us go, I will never return to Goryeo!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:11.390
Think about how we grew up together

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.490
Brother!

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.640
Darling

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.210
Doc...

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:50.590
It's okay, Doc, it's okay.

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:57.520
Doc, everything's fine. We'll live together, right?

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.590
Doc?

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.920
Doc!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.550
Doc! No...

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.700
Doc, don't

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.730
Soon Deok

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:18.950
Soon Duk...

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:09.640
Out of the way

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.540
Is it necessary to go that far?

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:16.100
The roots of treason must be destroyed so that the people can live in peace.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:17.920
Go away

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.060
Enough!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.250
Eun!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.990
Remember my birthday?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.280
You said you would give me any gift

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.760
Remember this?

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.740
I said there was only one thing you could give me

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.980
He made me say it

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.290
This girl...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.250
I won't let her go alone

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:32.750
Brother,

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.390
I would like such a gift

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.830
Only you can give it

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.820
No...

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:25.320
The flower will fall to the ground, it withered

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:39.220
He will be all alone, so sad

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.390
Eun!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:53.160
The sky will lose its stars, it will instantly become sad

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.060
No! Brother! Brother!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.460
Brother? Brother?

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.010
Brother?

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.260
B-brother...wake up, huh?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.320
Brother! Open your eyes!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:09:07.610
And suddenly it starts crying like a little rain

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:01.560
Brother...

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:21.000
It feels like a flower blooms and then withers

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:35.960
Tell me with the wind, please

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:11.360
With the appearance of snow, all dreams will come true

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:14.660
Oh, darling, aren't you waiting for me?

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:25.840
With all my heart I believe so, they are sincere

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:20.100
You were the first girl to treat me like that

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.420
What the hell is this?

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.510
What?

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:39.460
Do you know my heart that it always waits like this?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.080
You are the best!

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:30.980
Isn't His Majesty the most respected?

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.760
I think this finger is quite good

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.230
Let me go! Hey!

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:55.660
If so, come back

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.790
First love?

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.590
I told her:

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.840
The 13th prince is handsome,

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:12.420
The 14th Prince is talented in martial arts

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.580
Told her to choose one of them

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:22.190
And this girl insisted on marrying the 10th prince

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.250
He is her first love

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:34.190
If I had known this would happen, I would have stopped her

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:39.660
But she wouldn't listen, she would still marry him

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.740
This is how my Soon Duk was

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:49.960
She's true to herself, that would never change

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.610
Let me ask you one thing

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.450
My Soon Deok

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:09.710
received a lot of love from the prince?

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.250
A lot

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.920
A lot

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.940
They loved each other

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.070
Okay then

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.140
It's good

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.060
Okay

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.090
Sorry, Soon Deok

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:38.430
Now your father...

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.130
Your father can't do anything for you

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.210
Soon Duk...

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.570
I'll kill him

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.120
Wang So... I'll kill him

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.950
No... No

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.500
I'll kill him

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.820
Before he kills everyone, I'll kill him!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.230
Eun wanted this

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:21.610
This was Eun's wish

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.550
It's not his fault

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.230
It was hard for him too

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.190
Chi Mon

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.200
It looks like I

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.700
should become a killer dog

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:17.700
A dog that bites its owner
and will take over his farm

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.510
I'll become a rabid wolfhound

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:54.980
I, Wang So, will become the Emperor of Goryeo

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.480
Eun is dead

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.870
And his wife is dead too

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:14.090
Now Wang Gu's rebellion is not a fiction, but a fact

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:16.710
Congratulations

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.680
Now all clans will act in their own interests

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.090
We must hurry and make Seogyong the capital

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.540
This will satisfy Uncle Wang Sik Ryeom

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.040
There will be no funeral because he was called a traitor

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.900
We are not allowed to wear mourning clothes

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.540
They will not be buried in the cemetery for the imperial family,

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:52.020
and they will be thrown into the forest outside the palace to be devoured by crows

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:54.620
We will bury them secretly

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:02.020
We couldn't remove the arrows from Eun's body,

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:05.220
Jeong broke them

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.140
Eun...

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.370
still remembered my birthday

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.750
Even I already forgot about him

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:22.700
He said that only I could give this gift

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:33.360
Eun would be grateful for what you did for him

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.200
Prince So

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:47.550
I just found a letter
which Mrs. Su left for me

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.030
She wrote that the 10th prince was in Damiwon

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.810
Now in your eyes I must look like a monster

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:56.400
I killed Eun

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.300
It was a difficult choice

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:01.990
I know

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:04.210
Why did you hide the fact that he was in Damiwon?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.090
You don't trust me, right?

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:14.930
She didn't say anything because she was afraid that I would kill him.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.260
Yes

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.960
That's how it was

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.960
I was worried about the 10th prince

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:32.650
And I was afraid that you would have to do something terrible

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:38.350
I thought everything would go well and they would run away

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.660
I realized that we would hurt each other,

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.160
when it was too late

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.560
That's why I left a letter

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.720
I trusted you

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:58.790
I know it took time, but I trusted you

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:03.160
I could trust you in any situation,

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:08.130
because I realized that I like you

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:14.120
But now I don’t have such feelings

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.180
When I look at you

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:25.010
I remember what happened
due to lack of trust in me

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.280
Eun died because of you

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.950
I will remember how I killed him

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.370
To save you

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:39.990
I became the emperor's dog,
but my feelings remained unchanged

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:41.640
Now they've changed

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:48.520
I hide my tears deep inside

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:55.170
I want to forget everything about you

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.820
Let's stop

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.020
Lie

00:20:55.920 --> 00:21:02.470
It's time for us to leave the fate that brought us together

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:02.140
You're lying

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:10.820
Even in tears we will live with you

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:11.840
We promised not to lie to each other

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:16.940
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:24.420
I kept looking for the way to you, but I never found it

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:32.320
I couldn’t catch the fate that was moving away from me

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.560
So I'll let you go completely

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:44.680
I was like a fallen petal

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:51.700
I was sad because I had to end it all like this

00:21:52.640 --> 00:22:00.840
And if we meet again one day

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:05.340
Then we won’t say goodbye to you

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:08.120
Love

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.980
mine

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:14.450
4th Prince Wang So

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:19.440
The 10th Prince, the brother you stood up for, committed treason

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:22.260
You did a good job during the elimination of the prince and his wife Park Soon Deok

00:22:22.260 --> 00:22:28.200
So you will get land and a house near Songak

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.700
It seems your spirit is now in a state of decline,

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.490
so go to the new capital, Seogyeong

00:22:34.090 --> 00:22:36.420
You will be responsible for the construction of the palace

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:38.630
I trust this to you

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:40.380
I will dedicate myself to this cause

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:43.940
and I will repay you for your trust

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:52.900
Because of the blood shed...

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:55.680
aren't you scared?

00:22:56.410 --> 00:23:00.180
It's hard to sit on the throne without spilling someone's blood

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:03.160
Be careful

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:06.130
There's a limit to what I can get away with

00:23:06.130 --> 00:23:10.570
I will travel across the border and will not return to the palace

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:12.040
That's what you'll do

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:15.680
Still, think about your mother, don’t fight in the front ranks

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.560
Stay safe

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:21.550
I've lived like a coward for too long, so I can't

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:25.160
I want to see how long my life should be

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:29.580
I must pay for your crimes

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:36.660
For what you did to Eun

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.180
Brother!

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:00.190
Let us go!

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:06.660
Please! Brother!

00:24:15.030 --> 00:24:19.290
We should take sacrificial food for the departed to the Kaeguksa Temple

00:24:29.370 --> 00:24:31.970
Will you be responsible for the construction of the new palace?

00:24:31.970 --> 00:24:34.260
You will become rich

00:24:35.250 --> 00:24:38.630
He got it all by killing my daughter and son-in-law.

00:24:38.630 --> 00:24:40.810
Long life to you

00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:49.570
Is he even human? This is his little brother

00:25:27.630 --> 00:25:30.060
I heard you want to become an emperor

00:25:34.080 --> 00:25:35.170
Planned

00:25:38.070 --> 00:25:41.950
That deceiver next to you said that you have been planning for a long time

00:25:42.110 --> 00:25:44.970
He said that he saw your imperial star

00:25:46.780 --> 00:25:50.400
That's what your late father Taejo said

00:25:50.790 --> 00:25:52.760
That's why he sent you to me

00:25:53.420 --> 00:25:56.180
Wanted me to teach you martial arts

00:25:57.150 --> 00:25:58.830
All because of this

00:25:58.940 --> 00:26:00.130
Imperial star?

00:26:01.420 --> 00:26:02.790
I don't believe in such things

00:26:05.090 --> 00:26:06.710
But I must become emperor

00:26:08.020 --> 00:26:10.730
If I'm forced to kill for the throne...

00:26:11.710 --> 00:26:15.280
I will own it and put an end to the killings.

00:26:17.740 --> 00:26:21.770
Do you remember what the late emperor said earlier?

00:26:23.880 --> 00:26:28.150
For the sake of the nation and the imperial family

00:26:29.530 --> 00:26:32.830
the emperor must be ready to throw everything away

00:26:32.830 --> 00:26:35.380
The throne will force you to give up a lot

00:26:35.380 --> 00:26:36.620
I remember

00:26:38.010 --> 00:26:39.220
Well then

00:26:40.940 --> 00:26:42.860
who will you throw out?

00:26:44.950 --> 00:26:49.210
I want to be the first to see this

00:26:50.950 --> 00:26:52.690
Then I'll decide

00:26:57.000 --> 00:26:59.280
When I see you I

00:27:00.780 --> 00:27:04.090
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:27:04.280 --> 00:27:07.880
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:27:06.730 --> 00:27:09.170
Brother has already left for Sogyeong

00:27:09.340 --> 00:27:11.040
He'll be there for a long time

00:27:10.180 --> 00:27:14.780
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:27:14.780 --> 00:27:17.880
you won't even notice

00:27:18.580 --> 00:27:23.180
My heart is all given to you

00:27:25.080 --> 00:27:31.180
But loving you is very painful for me

00:27:31.180 --> 00:27:33.380
And so sad

00:27:33.380 --> 00:27:37.880
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:27:34.750 --> 00:27:36.540
I'll be waiting

00:27:39.180 --> 00:27:40.780
so hard

00:27:42.980 --> 00:27:47.080
Don't forget, please!

00:27:47.950 --> 00:27:52.380
That eternal love of mine

00:27:54.470 --> 00:28:00.570
But loving you is very painful for me

00:28:00.570 --> 00:28:02.770
And so sad

00:28:02.770 --> 00:28:07.870
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:28:08.570 --> 00:28:10.170
so hard

00:28:12.370 --> 00:28:16.470
I believe once upon a time

00:28:17.340 --> 00:28:21.770
how I want to love

00:28:20.470 --> 00:28:23.010
Senior lady! Senior lady!

00:28:22.450 --> 00:28:23.670
I can

00:28:23.870 --> 00:28:25.730
I told you, don't run

00:28:25.730 --> 00:28:27.670
You are now a court lady, behave with dignity

00:28:27.670 --> 00:28:28.740
Let's go quickly!

00:28:28.940 --> 00:28:31.280
You'll be glad to see him!

00:28:31.460 --> 00:28:32.280
Will I be happy?

00:28:32.280 --> 00:28:34.930
Two years have passed since his departure! You'll be glad!

00:28:42.370 --> 00:28:43.850
She asked me not to run

00:29:15.110 --> 00:29:16.220
Long time no see

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:19.340
It's been a long time

00:29:30.870 --> 00:29:31.760
Have a seat

00:29:44.090 --> 00:29:47.180
I arrived two days early
I really wanted to drink your tea

00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:51.410
But then I saw the place where Eun was buried...

00:29:52.010 --> 00:29:53.790
I had to go there

00:29:55.690 --> 00:29:57.010
I'm glad you went there

00:29:57.080 --> 00:29:58.900
And I also looked at my daughter-in-law

00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:02.570
I've done so much more than she ever did

00:30:02.870 --> 00:30:06.490
You are now a general, I feel uncomfortable next to you

00:30:07.840 --> 00:30:11.160
I was afraid that you would leave the palace during my absence

00:30:11.160 --> 00:30:13.040
Where would I go?

00:30:13.230 --> 00:30:14.970
What about marriage? Single?

00:30:15.700 --> 00:30:18.390
A girl from a good family can leave the palace if she gets married

00:30:19.310 --> 00:30:22.200
Should I get married and live my life taking care of someone?

00:30:22.990 --> 00:30:27.570
I want to leave my position when I'm older
and go somewhere far, far away

00:30:28.530 --> 00:30:32.560
I'll go to the desert, where I'll ride camels, I'll go to the ocean

00:30:34.380 --> 00:30:38.000
I keep all the money that they paid me

00:30:48.660 --> 00:30:49.930
Long time no see

00:30:49.930 --> 00:30:51.890
Wow, how long has it been?

00:30:51.890 --> 00:30:54.900
- I heard that you killed the Khitans in Khwai?
- Well, yes

00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:01.940
My name is Woo Hee

00:31:01.940 --> 00:31:03.890
This is the eldest court lady from the gisaeng house.

00:31:03.890 --> 00:31:06.740
She came for tea and treats for Buddhists

00:31:06.740 --> 00:31:08.310
The eldest lady of the gisaeng house?

00:31:09.550 --> 00:31:12.030
Oh, that former gisaeng?

00:31:13.560 --> 00:31:15.780
As always in bad company

00:31:15.780 --> 00:31:17.260
Killer and now gisaeng

00:31:19.990 --> 00:31:21.210
Watch your tongue

00:31:21.210 --> 00:31:23.130
Be careful with this person

00:31:23.130 --> 00:31:25.470
One day he might kill you

00:31:25.470 --> 00:31:29.950
Besides, can you stop sending a musician to spy on the army?

00:31:29.950 --> 00:31:32.050
Flute-playing spy?

00:31:32.050 --> 00:31:33.290
I won't talk to you

00:31:33.290 --> 00:31:36.490
Must have suffered a lot
once I began to suspect everyone

00:31:42.690 --> 00:31:46.190
This guy... How did he know?

00:31:46.190 --> 00:31:47.510
What a weasel

00:31:48.070 --> 00:31:51.080
He may be a general, but there's something cute about him

00:31:51.080 --> 00:31:53.250
Really? He's cute, right?

00:31:53.890 --> 00:31:55.980
Did you really send someone?

00:31:55.980 --> 00:31:57.960
I was wondering if he was doing everything right

00:31:58.840 --> 00:32:01.500
By the way, what's wrong with So? What chambers is he in?

00:32:03.760 --> 00:32:05.420
4th Prince...

00:32:07.070 --> 00:32:08.440
arrived?

00:32:09.240 --> 00:32:11.720
I just guessed whether he arrived or not...

00:33:04.200 --> 00:33:05.320
Yo

00:33:08.160 --> 00:33:09.290
Your Majesty

00:33:10.290 --> 00:33:13.330
Jeong is back. You have to make a decision

00:33:15.810 --> 00:33:18.690
Mother of Gyeong Jong Won Geun of Hubaekje

00:33:18.690 --> 00:33:22.030
You can't give Goryeo to someone with Hubaekje blood.

00:33:31.290 --> 00:33:33.730
Make Jeong crown prince

00:33:34.270 --> 00:33:36.740
You need someone to watch your back, Your Majesty

00:33:36.740 --> 00:33:41.350
Mother, how do you see me?

00:33:42.950 --> 00:33:46.580
Am I a man or a pig?

00:33:48.020 --> 00:33:49.540
You probably don't see me as a son,

00:33:50.320 --> 00:33:53.790
but only a boar, which you must sacrifice in exchange for the throne

00:34:00.890 --> 00:34:03.580
It's not like I'm going to die soon,

00:34:03.580 --> 00:34:05.980
but you've been tormenting me for years

00:34:14.230 --> 00:34:15.450
Jeong...

00:34:19.030 --> 00:34:20.930
Does he want to take the throne?

00:34:24.370 --> 00:34:27.670
His Highness the 4th Prince wishes to see His Majesty

00:34:41.220 --> 00:34:45.060
If you are so afraid, I will do it with the crown prince

00:34:45.420 --> 00:34:47.820
Jeong or Seo, they are both your sons

00:34:47.820 --> 00:34:49.020
What are you talking about?!

00:34:51.580 --> 00:34:53.380
We'll discuss this later!

00:35:02.260 --> 00:35:06.790
You're so useful

00:35:50.450 --> 00:35:52.320
What's wrong with a few dead slaves?

00:35:52.320 --> 00:35:54.180
to stop construction again?!

00:35:56.250 --> 00:35:58.320
The lands in Songak are weakening

00:35:58.740 --> 00:36:00.940
The line of the imperial family is in danger

00:36:00.940 --> 00:36:03.700
Both monks and shamans confirmed this

00:36:11.010 --> 00:36:12.700
We don't have enough manpower

00:36:12.700 --> 00:36:16.730
We don't have enough supplies, so people work one day and rest the next

00:36:27.930 --> 00:36:30.670
If you miss people, just don't let them sleep

00:36:30.670 --> 00:36:33.480
Not enough supplies - steal them if necessary

00:36:34.410 --> 00:36:38.300
Squeeze, squeeze all the strength out of them!

00:36:39.040 --> 00:36:40.970
Finish everything on time

00:36:56.460 --> 00:36:58.420
I have committed a mortal sin, Your Majesty

00:37:02.850 --> 00:37:06.030
Your Majesty, let's continue the conversation in private

00:37:45.260 --> 00:37:47.360
Are you still awake?

00:37:48.030 --> 00:37:52.650
I haven't seen you sleep well since I entered Damiwon.

00:37:52.650 --> 00:37:54.120
I'll go to bed soon

00:37:58.430 --> 00:38:02.300
What is it that you write so often lately?

00:38:03.390 --> 00:38:05.840
You're illiterate, but you noticed

00:38:05.840 --> 00:38:09.180
Yes, I'm illiterate, but I'm not blind

00:38:09.180 --> 00:38:10.750
Looks exactly the same

00:38:17.250 --> 00:38:18.850
I like the meaning

00:38:19.930 --> 00:38:22.420
“It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream,”

00:38:22.890 --> 00:38:24.540
"Squatting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance"

00:38:24.540 --> 00:38:28.170
He's a fool for coming all the way to the water

00:38:29.970 --> 00:38:32.910
If you can't sleep, maybe take a walk?

00:38:52.190 --> 00:38:54.760
Will you leave without seeing me?

00:38:57.990 --> 00:39:01.540
In these two years you have never come to me

00:39:02.200 --> 00:39:04.640
It seems they really forgot me

00:39:04.990 --> 00:39:07.740
Yes

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:10.880
I came here today by mistake

00:39:27.600 --> 00:39:30.980
I will become the darkness

00:39:27.700 --> 00:39:30.570
Nothing is over for me

00:39:31.240 --> 00:39:34.780
And I'll wrap you in myself

00:39:31.630 --> 00:39:34.740
So bear with me since you left without my consent

00:39:34.900 --> 00:39:38.530
Just for a day, just like that

00:39:35.500 --> 00:39:40.710
I... deserve at least this

00:39:39.030 --> 00:39:42.500
Stay with me

00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:46.230
And I will become the moon

00:39:46.580 --> 00:39:50.130
I will be the light for one

00:39:50.980 --> 00:39:56.400
Wherever I am, wherever I go, I will come

00:39:51.220 --> 00:39:54.260
Are you sleeping well?

00:39:54.260 --> 00:39:57.790
Are you eating well?

00:39:57.700 --> 00:40:01.650
You are my love, believe me

00:40:00.380 --> 00:40:02.800
Still

00:40:02.030 --> 00:40:05.930
You're the only one I need so much

00:40:04.830 --> 00:40:07.900
are you offended by me?

00:40:05.930 --> 00:40:09.650
I look at you from afar

00:40:09.900 --> 00:40:13.100
And I'll turn away again

00:40:13.200 --> 00:40:17.830
Here I confess to you alone

00:40:17.830 --> 00:40:21.730
With all my strength I

00:40:21.730 --> 00:40:24.950
Love, love, love

00:40:24.950 --> 00:40:32.380
Can you hear my heart now?

00:40:49.240 --> 00:40:52.610
Prince Wang So communicates closely
with some clans from Songak,

00:40:52.610 --> 00:40:55.120
he specifically prevents the construction of the palace

00:40:55.890 --> 00:40:58.250
He mixed gravel so the walls fell apart

00:40:58.550 --> 00:41:00.690
and released some workers

00:41:01.890 --> 00:41:03.020
Are you sure?

00:41:03.020 --> 00:41:04.130
There were also rumors

00:41:04.130 --> 00:41:05.730
that because of Wang Sik Ryeom's illness

00:41:05.730 --> 00:41:09.960
no one is monitoring the construction

00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:11.960
Why? Why?! Why?!

00:41:15.100 --> 00:41:17.440
What does he need?

00:41:18.540 --> 00:41:22.080
He didn't just go against my will...

00:41:24.610 --> 00:41:27.920
Throne...

00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:29.720
Is he aiming for the throne?

00:41:30.120 --> 00:41:31.250
Right?

00:41:31.250 --> 00:41:34.090
Let me ask you first

00:41:34.790 --> 00:41:37.560
Why did they violate our agreement?

00:41:38.490 --> 00:41:39.190
Agreement?

00:41:39.190 --> 00:41:41.900
People who cannot pay tribute
sent to forced labor

00:41:42.260 --> 00:41:43.600
Poor people from Hupaekje

00:41:43.600 --> 00:41:46.170
sent to a construction site where they die

00:41:46.800 --> 00:41:51.870
What's the point of continuing to be

00:41:52.510 --> 00:41:54.810
with your eyes and ears?

00:41:56.790 --> 00:41:59.550
And what? Do you want to leave?

00:41:59.550 --> 00:42:03.480
If there is no benefit for me

00:42:16.870 --> 00:42:19.430
Princess Woo Hee

00:42:19.430 --> 00:42:23.040
You didn't behave like that, did you?

00:42:24.610 --> 00:42:27.040
Do you know about Back A?

00:42:27.780 --> 00:42:30.850
His soul is very vulnerable and sensitive

00:42:30.850 --> 00:42:35.880
People of art, as a rule, are all like that

00:42:39.450 --> 00:42:43.930
I wonder what expression will be on his face

00:42:45.060 --> 00:42:49.460
when will he find out that you are my dog?

00:43:08.180 --> 00:43:10.620
I'm not alone, so it's okay

00:43:12.350 --> 00:43:14.740
The prince is with me! Why am I alone?

00:43:21.940 --> 00:43:23.950
You said you needed permission?

00:43:24.650 --> 00:43:27.650
Will you hear him?

00:43:25.230 --> 00:43:27.300
- Can?
- It is forbidden

00:43:27.900 --> 00:43:33.200
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:43:34.390 --> 00:43:38.190
In the future... don't forget these words

00:43:34.650 --> 00:43:37.100
Are you still listening?

00:43:37.100 --> 00:43:41.250
Can you hear my heart?

00:43:43.100 --> 00:43:47.370
How raindrops settled on the window

00:43:48.050 --> 00:43:53.820
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:43:54.570 --> 00:43:56.020
Need you

00:43:56.990 --> 00:43:58.620
Still

00:43:57.120 --> 00:43:58.700
Need you

00:43:59.700 --> 00:44:01.970
I miss you

00:44:01.390 --> 00:44:03.490
are you offended by me?

00:44:30.300 --> 00:44:32.480
From over there

00:44:33.660 --> 00:44:34.990
And Hae Soo with him

00:44:36.090 --> 00:44:37.840
Take a look at them

00:44:37.840 --> 00:44:41.990
I told you, you can rest assured that he will be your faithful dog, Your Majesty

00:44:43.410 --> 00:44:47.990
He'll be useful if I put a collar on him right now

00:44:48.630 --> 00:44:51.810
"These two don't have feelings for each other anymore, so it won't work."

00:44:52.390 --> 00:44:53.280
Do you believe it?

00:44:53.280 --> 00:44:55.820
I was told that they don't send each other any letters

00:44:55.820 --> 00:44:58.090
You still need to confirm it

00:44:58.090 --> 00:45:03.010
Slaves work well only when
if you flog them from time to time

00:45:11.650 --> 00:45:12.570
Stop

00:45:15.040 --> 00:45:17.210
It would be better not to see you at all

00:45:57.860 --> 00:45:59.240
Are you okay?

00:46:13.960 --> 00:46:17.430
It seemed to me that my hand was weakening,
so I decided to check myself

00:46:18.610 --> 00:46:19.850
Are you hurt?

00:46:19.850 --> 00:46:21.080
It barely hit me

00:46:23.220 --> 00:46:26.900
So you two are still on good terms

00:46:28.830 --> 00:46:32.840
If you killed a lady of the court for fun, not very good rumors would spread

00:46:32.840 --> 00:46:35.630
Yes, that wouldn't be good

00:46:37.790 --> 00:46:38.860
I didn't think

00:46:43.890 --> 00:46:44.990
Be careful

00:46:46.520 --> 00:46:48.880
What did I do?

00:47:33.250 --> 00:47:34.970
Did you want to see me?

00:47:34.970 --> 00:47:37.870
Can you convey a message to Baek Ah?

00:47:39.090 --> 00:47:40.380
Near Songak

00:47:42.490 --> 00:47:44.220
He was heading to Seogyong

00:47:44.220 --> 00:47:46.680
His hand began to hurt even more, so he resorted to treatment

00:47:48.180 --> 00:47:51.680
I sent everyone away, don't worry

00:47:54.550 --> 00:47:58.650
I'm still looking at you from the outside

00:48:01.770 --> 00:48:08.920
It seemed to me that you are my love

00:48:09.250 --> 00:48:13.650
I kept thinking that you feel the same way

00:48:14.500 --> 00:48:19.370
Although you look the other way

00:48:20.620 --> 00:48:28.900
Like the wind, like dust

00:48:29.050 --> 00:48:34.650
I can't catch you and see you

00:48:35.150 --> 00:48:43.300
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:48:43.300 --> 00:48:49.570
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:48:49.770 --> 00:48:57.650
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:48:57.870 --> 00:49:04.370
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:49:04.370 --> 00:49:10.750
And I can only answer you:

00:49:11.550 --> 00:49:18.050
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:49:18.050 --> 00:49:21.270
my love

00:50:43.320 --> 00:50:44.870
Why are you here?

00:50:46.020 --> 00:50:47.850
I have to ask something

00:50:49.210 --> 00:50:51.460
I asked Baek Ah for a favor

00:50:52.660 --> 00:50:54.080
Ask and leave

00:50:57.640 --> 00:50:59.620
Are you still

00:51:00.590 --> 00:51:02.390
have you forgotten me?

00:51:05.610 --> 00:51:08.310
You said you don't like me anymore

00:51:10.330 --> 00:51:11.980
You lied?

00:51:13.490 --> 00:51:14.630
Come back

00:51:19.650 --> 00:51:22.930
This is not a palace, the emperor will not see us

00:51:23.120 --> 00:51:25.930
I wanted to ask you a question,

00:51:25.930 --> 00:51:28.250
therefore, risking her life, she left the palace

00:51:29.240 --> 00:51:31.830
There wasn't a day when I wasn't waiting for you

00:51:32.880 --> 00:51:34.860
I want to go back to that time...

00:51:36.180 --> 00:51:39.770
I wish this again and again

00:51:40.630 --> 00:51:41.730
Therefore...

00:51:43.850 --> 00:51:45.390
I wanted to say

00:51:48.690 --> 00:51:50.660
that I believe you

00:51:55.500 --> 00:51:57.030
I'll ask again

00:51:57.900 --> 00:52:00.740
Answer me, but don't lie

00:52:01.980 --> 00:52:03.170
Reply

00:52:07.860 --> 00:52:09.150
Are you still

00:52:11.320 --> 00:52:12.340
love

00:52:16.320 --> 00:52:18.040
me?

00:52:43.090 --> 00:52:49.540
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:52:50.560 --> 00:52:57.160
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:52:58.140 --> 00:53:05.780
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:53:05.780 --> 00:53:11.660
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:53:13.320 --> 00:53:20.060
If you see my love and my feelings

00:53:21.090 --> 00:53:27.960
If you find my love and the path to me

00:53:28.600 --> 00:53:37.140
I will give my heart completely

00:53:37.140 --> 00:53:48.040
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:54:01.030 --> 00:54:07.460
Because you are next to me, I am grateful

00:54:08.570 --> 00:54:15.160
Because you are next to me, I always feel warm

00:54:09.780 --> 00:54:12.090
Nice, right?

00:54:12.100 --> 00:54:15.210
Come here, come here

00:54:16.180 --> 00:54:23.690
Because you are next to me, even in spirit I am strong

00:54:23.690 --> 00:54:30.060
I look at you and cry bitterly

00:54:31.570 --> 00:54:38.310
If you see my love and my feelings

00:54:39.160 --> 00:54:46.210
If you find my love and the path to me

00:54:46.850 --> 00:54:55.390
I will give my heart completely

00:54:52.240 --> 00:54:56.720
This square is Pegasus

00:54:55.390 --> 00:55:04.160
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:54:58.340 --> 00:55:00.500
W... what?

00:55:00.500 --> 00:55:03.450
- Pegasus
- Pe...

00:55:03.450 --> 00:55:05.180
Pesos

00:55:09.490 --> 00:55:13.610
I'm with you

00:55:18.590 --> 00:55:21.010
The Emperor is very sick

00:55:22.720 --> 00:55:25.550
The monk was about to perform sacrificial rites

00:55:25.710 --> 00:55:27.460
We thought we could scare the emperor

00:55:27.460 --> 00:55:29.500
so we chose the day
when lightning was supposed to strike

00:55:29.500 --> 00:55:33.490
We didn’t even think that the monk would die because of this very lightning strike

00:55:34.360 --> 00:55:35.460
Doctors say

00:55:35.460 --> 00:55:39.270
it amazed him greatly, so he weakened

00:55:40.800 --> 00:55:45.710
Help me get out, Yo!

00:55:45.710 --> 00:55:48.080
Brother! Please let us go!

00:55:49.080 --> 00:55:53.580
Think about how we grew up together

00:55:56.080 --> 00:55:58.580
Brother! Please let us go!

00:55:59.620 --> 00:56:01.990
I will never return to Goryeo again!

00:56:21.670 --> 00:56:24.210
Yo

00:56:26.310 --> 00:56:27.810
His Majesty?

00:56:30.320 --> 00:56:31.880
No...

00:56:32.490 --> 00:56:33.420
Don't... don't come near!

00:56:33.420 --> 00:56:34.590
Yo

00:56:34.590 --> 00:56:38.860
Don't come near! Don't come near! Don't come near!

00:56:51.610 --> 00:56:54.010
Your Majesty!

00:56:56.240 --> 00:56:57.860
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:56:57.860 --> 00:56:59.210
Your Majesty!

00:56:59.990 --> 00:57:01.680
Call the court physician! Immediately!

00:57:08.990 --> 00:57:10.190
Prepare your horse

00:57:10.190 --> 00:57:12.560
I will go to Seogyeong to see Wang Sik Ryeom!

00:57:18.230 --> 00:57:19.870
I think the time has come

00:57:23.170 --> 00:57:25.140
Princes Wook and Jeong left,

00:57:25.140 --> 00:57:29.440
while General Park and the Kang family of Shinju control the court army and other clans

00:57:29.640 --> 00:57:31.140
You have to make a decision

00:57:45.030 --> 00:57:47.370
Do you want to take the throne?

00:57:54.710 --> 00:57:55.830
I want

00:58:01.040 --> 00:58:02.900
The reason you left me...

00:58:04.820 --> 00:58:06.470
Was it because of the throne?

00:58:07.350 --> 00:58:09.700
The Emperor used you to get to me

00:58:10.620 --> 00:58:14.390
He will use me to bother you

00:58:17.980 --> 00:58:19.920
What if I asked you to give up?

00:58:25.910 --> 00:58:29.040
I'll convince you until you say I have to do it

00:58:33.610 --> 00:58:37.840
You said that as long as we are together,
you don't need to be an emperor

00:58:40.470 --> 00:58:41.850
Don't you say that anymore

00:58:44.100 --> 00:58:46.310
We agreed not to lie to each other

00:58:48.970 --> 00:58:53.610
I started this, I have to stop the brothers from killing each other

00:58:55.100 --> 00:58:56.150
But...

00:58:57.720 --> 00:58:59.550
When I was building the palace,

00:59:01.170 --> 00:59:05.060
I realized that the world can change if the ruler who rules it changes

00:59:10.570 --> 00:59:12.650
I don't want to be controlled

00:59:13.240 --> 00:59:15.780
And I can get rid of all this absurdity

00:59:17.240 --> 00:59:18.560
Become an emperor -

00:59:20.480 --> 00:59:22.280
what I want

00:59:28.730 --> 00:59:35.240
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:28.730 --> 00:59:35.240
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:35.240 --> 00:59:38.290
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:37.140 --> 00:59:43.740
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:59:38.610 --> 00:59:42.160
It's all because of you, girl! Because of your interference!

00:59:42.300 --> 00:59:45.530
If you want to become the owner of a palace,
must sacrifice something

00:59:43.740 --> 00:59:49.240
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

00:59:45.530 --> 00:59:50.700
- Long life to the emperor!
- Long life to the emperor!

00:59:49.240 --> 00:59:55.340
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

00:59:50.700 --> 00:59:53.180
You are just a thief who stole the throne from my son!

00:59:53.180 --> 00:59:56.350
You said that wanting both you and the throne is greed

00:59:55.580 --> 01:00:02.300
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

00:59:56.350 --> 00:59:58.140
How can I accept this?

00:59:59.780 --> 01:00:00.670
Kill!

01:00:01.090 --> 01:00:02.670
Don't miss out

01:00:02.420 --> 01:00:06.950
At the same time, in the same place we will be...

01:00:04.110 --> 01:00:05.280
none
